#### 7. **Chaos-Based Memory (ChaosCoreKernel)**

A **ChaosCoreKernel** káoszelméletű memóriát implementál:[21]

```zig
pub fn evolveChaoticState(
    state: *ChaosState, 
    dt: f64, 
    control_param: f64
) void {
    // Lorenz attractor vagy más chaotic system
    const sigma: f64 = 10.0;
    const rho: f64 = control_param;
    const beta: f64 = 8.0/3.0;

    state.x += sigma * (state.y - state.x) * dt;
    state.y += (state.x * (rho - state.z) - state.y) * dt;
    state.z += (state.x * state.y - beta * state.z) * dt;
}
```

