**JAIDE kauzális motor**:[21]
```zig
pub fn traceCausalChain(
    self: *const TemporalGraph, 
    effect: EventID
) ![]EventID {
    var causal_ancestors = ArrayList(EventID).init(self.allocator);
    var current = effect;

    while (self.findPredecessor(current)) |predecessor| {
        try causal_ancestors.append(predecessor);
        current = predecessor;
    }

    return causal_ancestors.toOwnedSlice();
}
```

A JAIDE **explicit kauzális gráfot** épít temporal verziókezeléssel, nem heurisztikus inference.[21]

